# ServoCommander

USB-stdio command console for the Waveshare Pico Servo Driver. Channels 0–15
drive Pico GP0–GP15 with 50 Hz PWM. The shell supports `help`, `list`, `get`,
`set`, `all`, `off`, and `quit`. Pulse commands are limited to 1000–2000 us;
all channels start at 1500 us. Readback reports the last commanded pulse width;
ordinary RC servos do not provide shaft-position feedback.
